---
// AccountAddSheet의 첫 계정 등록 화면. 이미 로그인된 계정을 가져오는 예시.
---

<div class="tour-account-sheet" data-tour-sheet aria-hidden="true" inert hidden lang="en">
  <div class="tour-sheet-head">
    <b>Add Claude Account</b>
    <button type="button">Cancel</button>
  </div>
  <div class="tour-provider-picker">
    <span class="is-selected">Claude</span>
    <span>Codex</span>
  </div>
  <p>If you're already signed in, OpenUsage imports that account without another login. Otherwise the official Claude sign-in opens in your browser.</p>
  <div class="tour-sheet-actions">
    <button type="button" data-tour-add-confirm>Add Account</button>
  </div>
</div>
